  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InspectableItem
  ItemName: Roof Vent Crank
  ItemDescription: 'The vent crank was wound open last night, and the vent was pulled
    shut again from outside: there are fresh hook scratches on the frame up top.
    Smeared on the handle is bright <b>violet pollen</b>. The Moonflower only sheds
    pollen when it blooms, at midnight.'
  ClueID: GH_VENT_CRANK
  NotebookNote: The vent was the way out. Violet midnight pollen on the crank.
  CanPickUp: 0
  DisplayOffset: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  DisplayEulerRotation: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
